WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.579
Hello!

2
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.728
Who

3
00:00:08.729 --> 00:00:11.831
are you? I'm

4
00:00:11.832 --> 00:00:15.603
a bottlenose dolphin. Dolphins

5
00:00:15.604 --> 00:00:19.236
are mammals. We're

6
00:00:19.237 --> 00:00:24.374
also very smart. Where

7
00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:26.840
do you live? We

8
00:00:26.841 --> 00:00:30.727
live all over the world. We

9
00:00:30.728 --> 00:00:35.385
like tropical oceans. Can

10
00:00:35.386 --> 00:00:38.867
you breathe underwater? No.

11
00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:44.026
We come up often for air. We

12
00:00:44.027 --> 00:00:49.400
breathe through our blowholes. What

13
00:00:49.401 --> 00:00:52.284
do you eat? We

14
00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:55.648
eat lots of fish. We

15
00:00:55.649 --> 00:01:01.043
also like squid and crabs. Do

16
00:01:01.044 --> 00:01:04.225
you live alone?

17
00:01:04.226 --> 00:01:09.852
No. Bottlenose dolphins live in big groups.

18
00:01:09.853 --> 00:01:13.787
These groups are called pods.

19
00:01:13.788 --> 00:01:18.223
Wow! You can jump out of the water!

20
00:01:18.224 --> 00:01:22.077
Dolphins can jump very high.

21
00:01:22.078 --> 00:01:25.024
And then . . .

22
00:01:25.025 --> 00:01:31.724
Splash!

23
00:01:31.725 --> 00:01:34.714
Do you have any enemies?

24
00:01:34.715 --> 00:01:38.738
Large sharks sometimes attack us.

25
00:01:38.739 --> 00:01:42.334
So do killer whales.

26
00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:49.315
We can get caught in fishing nets too.

27
00:01:49.316 --> 00:01:52.006
I see my pod.

28
00:01:52.007 --> 00:01:54.930
Good-bye!

29
00:01:54.931 --> 00:02:01.025
Bye, Bottlenose Dolphin!

